+                :py:class:`PatchIter`. Any further elements are ignored.
+            transform: transform applied to each patch alone, default is none.
+            with_coordinates: whether each element is a ``(patch, coordinates)`` pair (True) or only the patch
+                (False). Defaults to True.
+        """
